title: Delete asks first; Cancel keeps the file, Delete takes it off the disk and off the canvas
folders: edit-odd
limit: 50
forbid-log: nothing offers
expect-file: edit-odd/c.txt :: (?-i)\Afirst of c\nsecond of c\n\z
expect-file: edit-odd/a.txt :: (?-i)\Afirst of a
absent-file: edit-odd/b.txt

wait 3000
left files
delete c.txt
wait 600
mark asked
wait 400
answer Cancel
wait 600
delete b.txt
wait 600
answer Delete
wait 3500
mark b-gone
wait 400
quit
